<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">热爱社会主义祖国，忠诚于人民的教育事业；遵守国家法律法规，执行党的教育方针、政策，教书育人，为人师表，具有高尚的职业道德和修养；无有偿家教；近</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">年来年度考核均为合格等次以上。有敬业奉献、团结合作、开拓创新的精神和品质。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
