<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">绍兴市“名师名校长工程”采取项目方式，严格过程管理。建立培养人选“专业发展档案”和考核评价制度，实行动态管理、滚动发展。名师名校长培养周期为</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">年，期间由绍兴市“名师名校长工程”领导小组根据其职责要求，每年进行一次基本考核，满</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">年进行全面考核。培养对象凡能认真履行岗位职责，经过相应考核，可取得继续培养资格。凡脱离教学或教研第一线、不能履行岗位职责、年度考核不合格、违规违纪受到党纪、政纪处分等有损教师荣誉的，经报市教育局“名师名校长工程”领导小组同意后，取消其名师名校长培养资格，并停止享受有关待遇。名师名校长培养人选所在学校或单位要切实重视日常管理和考核工作，为培养人选的成长创造良好的工作、学习和生活环境。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">在工程实施期间，对新涌现出来的符合培养对象条件的特优教师，经所在学校推荐、市“名师名校长工程”领导小组考察、批准，可以破格补充为名师名校长培养对象。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">对培养人选经</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">年的培训、培养、实践锻炼，通过年度基本考核和总结考核，达到“绍兴市中小学名教师”和“绍兴市中小学名校长”培养目标的，由绍兴市教育局颁发相应的证书。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">（四）专题研修，促进培养人选专业化发展</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">针对绍兴市名师名校长培养人选的实际情况，制定具体的培养方案和个人专业发展计划，明确努力方向和具体措施，并实施多样化的培养方法。绍兴市“名师名校长工程”实行研修导师制，工程领导小组提供专家力量对培养人选进行业务指导。定期组织绍兴市名师名校长培养人选进行高级研修，通过走出去</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">,</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">请进来</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">,</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">组织专项理论学习，听取国内外高层次的教育专家举办的学术讲座，提高培养人选理论素养。通过组织培养人选去高校或教改前沿地区名校学习研修，组织部分培养对象走出国门，进行短期境外培训，拓宽视野，促进培养对象的知识更新。构建学习型研修群体，组织培养对象开展教育教学实验和教育教学科研，撰写研究文章、专著，组织多种形式的教学研讨，进行案例分析，交流学习心得，促进共同提高。组织培养对象举办学术讲座，开展阶段性成果展示和示范教学等，提高培养对象实施新课程的能力和水平，发挥名优教师示范辐射作用。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">五、加强领导，确保成效</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">（一）加大投入，确保工程实施效果</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">设立专项资金，进行重点资助。各县（市、区）教育局和学校应分别设立专项资金，每人年均不少于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">万元，专款专用，重点资助培养人选进行教育教学研究和实验、进修学习、征订书刊资料、参加高层次的学术交流活动、出版教育教学专著等。实行政策倾斜，进行重点支持。对培养人选在科研立项、进修提高、学术研讨、教育考察等方面，各地、各校要给予优先安排；在教师职务评聘，特级教师和省、市级教坛新秀、学科带头人评选，政府特殊津贴和拔尖人才推荐时，各级教育行政部门对符合条件的培养人选要给予优先考虑，并进入教育局人才库；培养人选在实施此项计划的</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">年内，每年可享受不少于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">10</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">天的学术假。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">（二）加强领导，认真做好项目实施规划</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">市教育局成立名师名校长工程领导小组，组长由市教育局局长陈国阳担任，副组长由市教育局党委副书记李妙芳、市教育局副局长钱伟平担任，成员由市教育局政治处处长陈培其、师范教育处处长马神光、普教处处长徐炳校、职成教处处长董建明、教育教学研究院院长沈江峰、电教馆馆长任关海、幼教办副主任陶琼、教育教学研究院副院长吕华荣、赵关军组成。领导小组下设办公室，办公室设在市教育局师范教育处，具体负责绍兴市名师名校长规划、协调与培养人选的选拔等工作。绍兴市教育教学研究院是绍兴市名师名校长工程实施的主要培训基地，具体负责名师名校长人选的培养、管理、考核等日常工作和教务管理。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">各县（市、区）要把实施“名师名校长工程”纳入本地区教师和校长队伍建设的总体规划，作为“十二五”师、干训工作规划的一项基础性工程，切实加强组织协调，加大投入力度，整合工作资源，完善工作机制，统筹做好“名师名校长工程”实施工作，确保工程质量。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">请各县（市、区）将《绍兴市名师名校长培养对象申报汇总表》于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">20</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">日前报市教育局师范处，同时将《绍兴市名师名校长培养对象申报汇总表》和相关申报材料报市教育教学研究院俞英老师（联系电话：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">88905125</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">，邮箱：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><A href="mailto:sxtejijiaoshi@163.com"><SPAN style="COLOR: black"><U>sxtejijiaoshi@163.com</U></SPAN></A></SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
